===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/ˈtiː.ɡris/|lang=la}}
* {{audio|la-cls-tigris.ogg|Audio (Classical)}}

===Noun===
{{head|la|noun|head=tīgris|genitive|tigris, [[tigridis|tīgridis]]}}; {{m}}, ''[[Appendix:Latin third declension|third declension]]''

# [[tiger]]
# {{poetic|lang=la}} [[tigress]]
