====Inflection====
The declension of this noun is varied. When declined like a parasyllabic '''i'''-stem, the accusative singular may be [[tigrem]] and the ablative singular may be [[tigri#Latin|tigrī]].

{{la-decl-3rd-PAR-navis|tigris|tīgris|tigr|tīgr}} or {{la-decl-3rd|tigris|tīgris|tigrid|tīgrid}}

